nodes.body:
@itayalroy @njhill #53934 fixed the first bug below for MRv2 but not the second so this PR fixes both so I think we should merge this. The bugs are:
1. MRv1 never resets the drafter on scale so its old CUDA graphs still point to freed memory and crash with `illegal memory access
2. once the drafter resets, it rebuilds with the target tag and config and loads the wrong compiled graph so I made it keep its own

